Szemerédi regularity and the blow-up lemma, handles low minimum degree in
Lemma 7, low connectivity of the reduced graph in Lemma 8, and a large
independent set in Lemma 9.  In the remaining case it uses Ore's theorem on the
reduced graph, super-regular pairs, and the absorbing Claim 1.  These are the
